{"questions":[{"question_id":"1l17houxe","paperTitle":"JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 2 Offline","year":2014,"examDate":2014,"subject":"physics","chapter":"atoms-and-nuclei","chapterGroup":"modern-physics","topic":"bohrs-model-and-hydrogen-spectrum","type":"mcq","marks":3,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"pif-lambdasubcusub-is-the-wavelength-of-ksub-jee-advanced-physics-units-and-measurements-aflnlksyue9n7jcb","content":"<p>If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>Cu</sub> is the wavelength of K<sub><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></sub> X-ray line of copper (atomic number 29) and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>Mo</sub> is the wavelength of the K<sub><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></sub> X-ray line of molybdenum (atomic number 42), then the ratio <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>Cu</sub>/<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>Mo</sub> is close to</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"1.99"},{"identifier":"B","content":"2.14"},{"identifier":"C","content":"0.50"},{"identifier":"D","content":"0.48"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>The wavelength of the K<sub><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></sub> X-ray line is related to the atomic number of the element by Moseley's law, which can be expressed as:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.722ex\" height=\"2.483ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -847.5 6949 1097.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,-12.5)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D708\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D708\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"530\" height=\"60\" x=\"853\" y=\"727.5\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1660.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2716.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3466.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3855.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4800.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5801,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6560,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Here, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.005ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.199ex\" height=\"1.005ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 530 444\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D708\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D708\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the frequency of the emitted X-ray, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.636ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 723 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the atomic number, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.697ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 750 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.717ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 759 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are constants. Given that the wavelength <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is inversely proportional to the frequency <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.005ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.199ex\" height=\"1.005ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 530 444\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D708\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D708\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.8ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.144ex\" height=\"2.398ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -706.5 2715.8 1060\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D708\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D708\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(807.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1863.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(273,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><rect width=\"612.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.98ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 433 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the speed of light), we can rewrite this equation in terms of wavelength:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.254ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.89ex\" height=\"3.211ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4813.4 1419.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"221D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1271.7,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-377.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1112,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1890,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2649,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(422,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><rect width=\"2656.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Now, let's consider the ratio of the wavelengths for copper (Cu) and molybdenum (Mo):</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.469ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16.922ex\" height=\"4.518ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1347.5 7479.5 1997\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(271,457.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45C\"></use></g></g></g><rect width=\"1438.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1956.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3012.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(597,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,451.6) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(716,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45C\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1852.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2630.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(271,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(716,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=